        <description>Visit Activity Logger captures, updates, and maintains on‑ground visit execution details for retail locations.
It records field observations, task completion, status updates, and outcomes from Consumer Goods Cloud Visits, ensuring that real‑world execution intelligence is reflected accurately in Salesforce.

This agent gets retail store evaluation details and scorecard 

The sub‑agent updates visit records with observations, competitor sightings, footfall notes, photos, and completion status, and synchronizes these updates with ongoing AI‑driven expansion and readiness evaluations.
By maintaining an accurate visit history, it enables Agentforce to refine confidence scores, reassess risks, and incorporate human‑validated insights into retail decision‑making.</description>
