        <description>Evaluate Retail Readiness determines whether a candidate retail location is prepared for expansion by holistically assessing market demand, competitive pressure, financial viability, and on‑ground validation.
The sub‑agent synthesizes insights from Salesforce Data Cloud (demographics, footfall, POS performance, competition intelligence) and Consumer Goods Cloud Visit Execution (site visits, field observations, execution risks) to classify locations as Ready, Needs Review, or Not Ready.
It provides an explainable recommendation with confidence level and key drivers, ensuring expansion decisions are data‑driven, financially sound, and validated by real‑world execution signals before capital commitment.</description>
